        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>人民日报·创新中国——这个冬天，兴安盟文旅“火力全开”</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]}\n};\n</script>\n<script defer src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  html, body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #d8d8d8;\n  }\n  body {\n    color: #171717;\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", \"Noto Serif CJK SC\", serif;\n  }\n  .page {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 790px;\n    min-height: 1218px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    background: #fff;\n    padding: 35px 14px 18px;\n  }\n\n  /* Masthead */\n  .masthead {\n    position: relative;\n    height: 33px;\n    border-bottom: 2px solid #0a5b85;\n  }\n  .date {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 7px;\n    top: 3px;\n    font-size: 7px;\n    line-height: 1.45;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .paper-name {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 340px;\n    top: -5px;\n    color: #c90018;\n    font-family: \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", serif;\n    font-size: 25px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .paper-seal {\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 12px;\n    height: 27px;\n    margin-left: 2px;\n    padding: 1px;\n    vertical-align: -4px;\n    color: #fff;\n    background: #c90018;\n    font: 5px/1.15 \"SimSun\", serif;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .section-tab {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 36px;\n    top: -3px;\n    height: 30px;\n    padding: 3px 9px 0;\n    color: #fff;\n    background: #07577e;\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n    font-size: 19px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  .page-number {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 1px;\n    top: -5px;\n    color: #111;\n    f